
---

# 3. `.gitignore`

Before Flutter generates its normal `.gitignore`, use this small initial version:

```gitignore
# Operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# Environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
service-account*.json

# Temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Codex/local work
.codex/

.claude/